8
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,540
Black bears came to fight for food.

9
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:28,820
If there is any leakage today, it can be reduced

10
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:57,300
Just now

11
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,300
Bear's paw is there
